{"product_id":"the-enormouse-pearl-heist-geronimo-stilton-no-51","title":"The Enormouse Pearl Heist (Geronimo Stilton, No.51)","description":"\u003cp\u003eEach Geronimo book is fast-paced, with lively full-color art and a unique format kids 7-10 will love.One day, my friends and I, Geronimo Stilton, made an amazing discovery. We found a huge oyster -- with an enormouse pearl inside! I was so excited about this extremely rare, precious pearl that I wrote a special feature about it in The Rodent's Gazette. That article attracted lots of attention -- both good and bad! The enormouse pearl was in danger of being stolen. Would my friends and I be able to protect it?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 188 x 6\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Geronimo Stilton\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780545341035\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45744222994585,"sku":"16RB-2-9780545341035","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d3d64f8d6a8_The_Enormouse_Pearl_Heist__Geronimo_Stilton__No.51__Geronimo_Stilton.jpg?v=1758732805","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-enormouse-pearl-heist-geronimo-stilton-no-51","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}